  ('Flanged Stainless Steel Shaft for REV Motion Pattern (8mm REX®, 29mm Length)', '2105-4008-0029', 'This 8mm REX® profile shaft is for those of you FTC Teams that wish to fasten an 8mm REX® shaft to the REV motion pattern, such as found on their REV Ultraplanetary Gearbox. This steel output shaft gives you that extra bit of beef so you can use the Ultraplanetary in heavy duty applications without fear of a shaft failure. The 29mm length, when paired with the REV Ultraplanetary Mount, yields 24mm of shaft protruding past the mounting face to match up with the 24mm shaft length of the goBILDA…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/flanged-stainless-steel-shaft-for-rev-motion-pattern-8mm-rex-29mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1361/images/6652/2105-4008-0029__38479__14942.1701992920.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'STRUCTURE / Pattern Adaptors', 'gobilda'),
  ('8mm REX® Shaft with E-Clip (Stainless Steel, 24mm Length)', '2106-4008-0240', 'This feature-rich 24mm length shaft rocks an 8mm REX® profile: a combination of an 8mm Round and a 7mm hEX profile. The round profile gives you the ability to run this shaft in 8mm round bore bearings (though we do offer a plethora of 8mm REX® bore bearings and pillow blocks). The hex profile, meanwhile, provides the positive drive your project deserves. Threaded ends allow you to use these shafts as conventional standoffs, create dead axles, and fasten items to their ends with ease. The…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/8mm-rex-shaft-with-e-clip-stainless-steel-24mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1547/images/8085/2106-4008-0240__24826__18002.1701993355.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Shafting & Tubing / Stainless Steel REX® Shafting', 'gobilda'),
