  ('goBILDA Blackout Hat — S/M', '2203-0103-0101', 'The goBILDA Blackout Hat features our "go" emblem in a black raised stitching. Equal parts subtle and bold, this hat goes with any attire!', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/gobilda-blackout-hat/?sku=2203-0103-0101', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1425/images/7055/male-hat-blackout-02.min__52016__31550.1730383030.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MERCH', 'gobilda'),
