  ('2301 Series Brass, MOD 0.8 Pinion Gear (6mm D-Bore, 15 Tooth)', '2301-0006-0015', 'This MOD 0.8 pinion gear, while aesthetically unique compared to the larger pinion gears, will operate the same. Due to the small overall diameter, the set screw hole has been machined through the teeth to maximize the number of threads engaged with the set screw. While this gear is compatible with any MOD 0.8 gear, its most common partner is a 105 tooth hub gear. This combo will create a 7:1 ratio, underdrive or overdrive depending on whether you''re set out to increase the speed or maximize…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2301-series-brass-mod-0-8-pinion-gear-6mm-d-bore-15-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2045/images/11203/2301-0006-0015__93741__39628.1702331225.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('2301 Series Brass, MOD 0.8, D-Bore, Set Screw Pinion Gear (6mm D-Bore, 20 Tooth)', '2301-0006-0020', 'This product in discontinued. It has been replaced by 2303-1006-0020. This 20 tooth, MOD 0.8 gear will mate with any MOD 0.8 gear. However when building on pattern, the most common partner for this gear is a 100 tooth hub gear. This combo will create a 5:1 ratio, underdrive or overdrive depending on whether you''re set out to increase the speed or maximize torque.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2301-series-brass-mod-0-8-d-bore-set-screw-pinion-gear-6mm-d-bore-20-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/436/images/3004/2301-0006-0020__14314__37263.1701991757.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('2301 Series Brass, MOD 0.8, D-Bore, Set-Screw Pinion Gear (6mm D-Bore, 24 Tooth)', '2301-0006-0024', 'This 24 tooth, MOD 0.8 gear will mate with any MOD 0.8 gear. However when building on pattern, the most common partner for this gear is a 96 tooth hub gear. This combo will create a 4:1 ratio, underdrive or overdrive depending on whether you''re set out to increase the speed or maximize torque.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2301-series-brass-mod-0-8-d-bore-set-screw-pinion-gear-6mm-d-bore-24-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2046/images/11209/2301-0006-0024__71596__42635.1702331451.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('2301 Series Brass, MOD 0.8, D-Bore, Set Screw Pinion Gear (6mm D-Bore, 30 Tooth)', '2301-0006-0030', 'This gear has been discontinued. It has been replaced by the 2303-1006-0030 This 30 tooth, MOD 0.8 gear will mate with any MOD 0.8 gear. However when building on pattern, the most common partners for this gear are another 30 tooth gear, or a 90 tooth hub gear. Utilizing a second 30 tooth gear will create a compact 1:1 ratio on a 24mm center distance. A 1:1 ratio is useful when you have an assembly where you want two pieces to move at the same time, but in opposite directions. Mating with a 90…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2301-series-brass-mod-0-8-d-bore-set-screw-pinion-gear-6mm-d-bore-30-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/440/images/3036/2301-0006-0030__32519__25252.1701991766.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('2302 Series Aluminum, MOD 0.8, Hub Mount Gear (14mm Bore, 48 Tooth)', '2302-0014-0048', 'The 48 tooth, MOD 0.8 gear is the smallest hub gear we offer. While it is able to mate with any MOD 0.8 gear, it''s most common partner is a 12 tooth servo gear. This combo would create a 4:1 underdrive ratio increasing the torque and decreasing the speed of the servo. Center-to-center spacing would be 24mm.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2302-series-aluminum-mod-0-8-hub-mount-gear-14mm-bore-48-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/433/images/2987/2302-0014-0048__60267__26069.1701991751.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Hub Mount Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2302 Series Aluminum, MOD 0.8, Hub Mount Gear (14mm Bore, 60 Tooth)', '2302-0014-0060', 'The 60 tooth, MOD 0.8 gear will mate with any MOD 0.8 gear, but when building on pattern, the most common partner for this gear is another 60 tooth gear to create a 1:1 ratio. A 1:1 ratio is useful when you have an assembly where you want two pieces to move at the same time, but in opposite directions. A good example of this would be a gripper.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2302-series-aluminum-mod-0-8-hub-mount-gear-14mm-bore-60-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/435/images/3000/2302-0014-0060__41110__91197.1701991756.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Hub Mount Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2302 Series Aluminum, MOD 0.8, Hub Mount Gear (14mm Bore, 80 Tooth)', '2302-0014-0080', 'The 80 tooth, MOD 0.8 gear will mate with any MOD 0.8 gear, but when building on pattern, the most common partner for this gear is a 40 tooth Servo Gear. The combo creates a 2:1 underdrive, slowing the final speed while increasing the torque twofold.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2302-series-aluminum-mod-0-8-hub-mount-gear-14mm-bore-80-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/437/images/3014/2302-0014-0080__87464__56685.1701991759.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Hub Mount Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2302 Series Aluminum, MOD 0.8, Hub Mount Gear (14mm Bore, 90 Tooth)', '2302-0014-0090', 'The 90 tooth, MOD 0.8 gear will mate with any MOD 0.8 gear, but when building on pattern, the most common partner for this gear is a 30 tooth pinion gear or servo gear. Using the pinion gear you can create 3:1 underdrive or overdrive setup depending on your application. When used with the 30 tooth servo gear, the combo creates a 3:1 underdrive, slowing the final speed while increasing the torque by 3x.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2302-series-aluminum-mod-0-8-hub-mount-gear-14mm-bore-90-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/439/images/3030/2302-0014-0090__64305__98452.1701991764.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Hub Mount Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2302 Series Aluminum, MOD 0.8, Hub Mount Gear (14mm Bore, 96 Tooth)', '2302-0014-0096', 'The 96 tooth, MOD 0.8 gear will mate with any MOD 0.8 gear, but when building on pattern, the most common partner for this gear is a 24 tooth pinion gear or servo gear. Using the pinion gear you can create 4:1 underdrive or overdrive setup depending on your application. When used with the 24 tooth servo gear, the combo creates a 4:1 underdrive, slowing the final speed while increasing the torque by 4x.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2302-series-aluminum-mod-0-8-hub-mount-gear-14mm-bore-96-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/441/images/3046/2302-0014-0096__85935__56297.1701991769.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Hub Mount Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2302 Series Aluminum, MOD 0.8, Hub Mount Gear (14mm Bore, 100 Tooth)', '2302-0014-0100', 'The 100 tooth, MOD 0.8 gear will mate with any MOD 0.8 gear, but when building on pattern, the most common partner for this gear is a 20 tooth pinion gear or servo gear. Using the pinion gear you can create a 5:1 underdrive or overdrive setup depending on your application. When used with the 20 tooth servo gear, the combo creates a 5:1 underdrive, slowing the final speed while increasing the torque by 5x.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2302-series-aluminum-mod-0-8-hub-mount-gear-14mm-bore-100-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/443/images/3069/2302-0014-0100__05592__18602.1701991778.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Hub Mount Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2302 Series Aluminum, MOD 0.8, Hub Mount Gear (14mm Bore, 105 Tooth)', '2302-0014-0105', 'The 105 tooth, MOD 0.8 gear will mate with any MOD 0.8 gear, but when building on pattern, the most common partner for this gear is a 15 tooth pinion gear or servo gear. Using the pinion gear you can create a 7:1 underdrive or overdrive setup depending on your application. When used with the 15 tooth servo gear, the combo creates a 7:1 underdrive, slowing the final speed while increasing the torque by 7x.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2302-series-aluminum-mod-0-8-hub-mount-gear-14mm-bore-105-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/445/images/3087/2302-0014-0105__15081__39068.1701991783.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Hub Mount Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2302 Series Aluminum, MOD 0.8, Hub Mount Gear (14mm Bore, 108 Tooth)', '2302-0014-0108', 'The 105 tooth, MOD 0.8 gear will mate with any MOD 0.8 gear, but when building on pattern, the most common partner for this gear is a 12 tooth servo gear. When used with the 12 tooth servo gear, the combo creates a 9:1 underdrive, slowing the final speed while increasing the torque by 9x.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2302-series-aluminum-mod-0-8-hub-mount-gear-14mm-bore-108-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/447/images/3107/2302-0014-0108__74591__85137.1701991789.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Hub Mount Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2302 Series Aluminum, MOD 0.8, Hub Mount Gear (32mm Bore, 80 Tooth)', '2302-0032-0080', 'The 80 tooth, MOD 0.8 gear will mate with any MOD 0.8 gear, but when building on pattern, the most common partner for this gear is a 40 tooth servo gear. The combo creates a 2:1 underdrive, slowing the final speed while increasing the torque twofold.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2302-series-aluminum-mod-0-8-hub-mount-gear-32mm-bore-80-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/449/images/3125/2302-0032-0080__89169__74786.1701991794.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Hub Mount Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2302 Series Aluminum, MOD 0.8, Hub Mount Gear (32mm Bore, 90 Tooth)', '2302-0032-0090', 'The 90 tooth, MOD 0.8 gear will mate with any MOD 0.8 gear, but when building on pattern, the most common partner for this gear is a 30 tooth pinion gear or servo gear. Using the pinion gear you can create 3:1 underdrive or overdrive setup depending on your application. When used with the 30 tooth servo gear, the combo creates a 3:1 underdrive, slowing the final speed while increasing the torque by 3x.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2302-series-aluminum-mod-0-8-hub-mount-gear-32mm-bore-90-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/451/images/3138/2302-0032-0090-2__81850__53149.1701991798.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Hub Mount Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2302 Series Aluminum, MOD 0.8, Hub Mount Gear (32mm Bore, 96 Tooth)', '2302-0032-0096', 'The 96 tooth, MOD 0.8 gear will mate with any MOD 0.8 gear, but when building on pattern, the most common partner for this gear is a 24 tooth pinion gear or servo gear. Using the pinion gear you can create 4:1 underdrive or overdrive setup depending on your application. When used with the 24 tooth servo gear, the combo creates a 4:1 underdrive, slowing the final speed while increasing the torque by 4x.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2302-series-aluminum-mod-0-8-hub-mount-gear-32mm-bore-96-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/442/images/3057/2302-0032-0096__43883__91955.1701991774.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Hub Mount Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2302 Series Aluminum, MOD 0.8, Hub Mount Gear (32mm Bore, 100 Tooth)', '2302-0032-0100', 'The 100 tooth, MOD 0.8 gear will mate with any MOD 0.8 gear. However when building on pattern, the most common partner for this gear is a 20 tooth pinion gear or servo gear. Utilizing a pinion gear you can create a 5:1 underdrive or overdrive setup depending on your application. When used with the 20 tooth servo gear, the combo creates a 5:1 underdrive, slowing the final speed while increasing the torque by 5x.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2302-series-aluminum-mod-0-8-hub-mount-gear-32mm-bore-100-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/444/images/3078/2302-0032-0100__81695__31717.1701991780.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Hub Mount Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2302 Series Aluminum, MOD 0.8, Hub Mount Gear (32mm Bore, 105 Tooth)', '2302-0032-0105', 'The 105 tooth, MOD 0.8 gear will mate with any MOD 0.8 gear. However when building on pattern, the most common partner for this gear is a 15 tooth pinion gear or servo gear. Utilizing a pinion gear you can create a 7:1 underdrive or overdrive setup depending on your application. When used with the 15 tooth servo gear, this combo creates a 7:1 underdrive, slowing the final speed while increasing the torque by 7x.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2302-series-aluminum-mod-0-8-hub-mount-gear-32mm-bore-105-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/446/images/3096/2302-0032-0105__66474__60362.1701991786.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Hub Mount Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2302 Series Aluminum, MOD 0.8, Hub Mount Gear (32mm Bore, 108 Tooth)', '2302-0032-0108', 'The 105 tooth, MOD 0.8 gear will mate with any MOD 0.8 gear. However when building on pattern, the most common partner for this gear is a 12 tooth servo gear. When used with the 12 tooth servo gear, the combo creates a 9:1 underdrive, slowing the final speed while increasing the torque by 9x.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2302-series-aluminum-mod-0-8-hub-mount-gear-32mm-bore-108-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/448/images/3116/2302-0032-0108__91407__13281.1701991791.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Hub Mount Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2303 Series Steel, MOD 0.8 Pinion Gear (6mm D-Bore, 15 Tooth)', '2303-1006-0015', 'This 15 Tooth, MOD 0.8 Steel Pinion Gear has a 6mm D-bore for positive drive on 6mm D-profile shafting. While a 105 tooth MOD 0.8 hub-mount gear is a perfect partner for this gear when you''re building on the goBILDA® pattern and want to create a 7:1 ratio, this gear can mesh with any fellow MOD 0.8 gear to produce an underdrive or overdrive ratio—depending on if you''d like to increase the speed, or maximize torque. The built-in shim on the bottom of the gear allows you to run this gear up…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2303-series-steel-mod-0-8-pinion-gear-6mm-d-bore-15-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2345/images/14338/2303-1006-0015-Ang1__49924__24857.1736788082.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Pinion Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2303 Series Steel, MOD 0.8 Pinion Gear (6mm D-Bore, 20 Tooth)', '2303-1006-0020', 'This 20 tooth 6mm D-bore pinion gear perfectly matches our 6mm D-shafting to create a positive drive. This particular gear is able to be meshed with a 100 tooth hub gear spaced 48mm away for a 5:1 ratio on channel. If your build provides the freedom to adjust the spacing between your gears, it''s able to mesh to any MOD 0.8 gear that suits your fancy.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2303-series-steel-mod-0-8-pinion-gear-6mm-d-bore-20-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1377/images/14489/2303-1006-0020_Ang1__56824.1740599153.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Pinion Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2303 Series Steel, MOD 0.8 Pinion Gear (6mm D-Bore, 24 Tooth)', '2303-1006-0024', 'This 24 Tooth, MOD 0.8 Steel Pinion Gear rocks a 6mm D-bore for positive drive on 6mm D-profile shafting. While a 96 tooth MOD 0.8 hub-mount gear is a perfect partner for this gear when you''re building on the goBILDA® pattern and want to create a 4:1 ratio, this gear can mesh with any fellow MOD 0.8 gear to produce an underdrive or overdrive ratio—depending on if you''d like to increase the speed, or maximize torque. The built-in shim on the bottom of the gear allows you to run this gear up…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2303-series-steel-mod-0-8-pinion-gear-6mm-d-bore-24-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2103/images/14493/2303-1006-0024_Ang1__55819.1740599308.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Pinion Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2303 Series Steel, MOD 0.8 Pinion Gear (6mm D-Bore, 30 Tooth)', '2303-1006-0030', 'This 30 tooth 6mm D-bore pinion gear perfectly matches our 6mm D-shafting to create a positive drive. This particular gear is able to be meshed with a 90 tooth hub gear spaced 48mm away for a 3:1 ratio, or, it can mate to another 30 tooth gear to create a very compact 1:1 ratio only 24mm apart! If your build provides the freedom to adjust the spacing between your gears, it''s able to mesh to any MOD 0.8 gear that suits your fancy. Notice the counterbore on the top side of the gear - this allows…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2303-series-steel-mod-0-8-pinion-gear-6mm-d-bore-30-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1376/images/14495/2303-1006-0030_Ang1__29963.1740599414.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Pinion Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2303 Series Steel, MOD 0.8 Pinion Gear (8mm REX® Bore, 20 Tooth)', '2303-4008-0020', 'This 20 tooth 8mm REX® bore pinion gear is ready to rip! The bore perfectly matches our 8mm REX® shafting to create a positive drive. While little work is left for the set screws, we put two of them in for good measure. This particular gear is most commonly mated to a 100 tooth hub gear in order to create a 5:1 ratio however if your build provides the freedom to adjust the spacing between your gears, it''s able to mesh to any MOD 0.8 gear that suits your fancy. SET-SCREW WITH THREAD-LOCKING…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2303-series-steel-mod-0-8-pinion-gear-8mm-rex-bore-20-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1312/images/14922/2303-4008-0020_REV1_Ang1__03873.1749224418.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Pinion Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2303 Series Steel, MOD 0.8 Pinion Gear (8mm REX® Bore, 24 Tooth)', '2303-4008-0024', 'This 24 tooth 8mm REX® bore pinion gear is ready to rip! The bore perfectly matches our 8mm REX® shafting to create a positive drive. While little work is left for the set screws, we put two of them in for good measure. This particular gear is most commonly mated to a 96 tooth hub gear to create a 4:1 ratio. However, if your build provides the freedom to adjust the spacing between your gears, it''s able to mesh to any MOD 0.8 gear that suits your fancy. Notice the counterbore on the top side of…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2303-series-steel-mod-0-8-pinion-gear-8mm-rex-bore-24-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1314/images/14482/2303-4008-0024_Ang1__90966.1740511283.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Pinion Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2303 Series Steel, MOD 0.8 Pinion Gear (8mm REX™ Bore, 30 Tooth)', '2303-4008-0030', 'This 30 tooth 8mm REX® bore pinion gear is ready to rip! The bore perfectly matches our 8mm REX® shafting to create a positive drive. While little work is left for the set-screws, we put two of them in for good measure. This particular gear is able to be meshed with a 90 tooth hub gear spaced 48mm away for a 3:1 ratio, or, it can mate to another 30 tooth gear to create a very compact 1:1 ratio only 24mm apart! If your build provides the freedom to adjust the spacing between your gears, it''s…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2303-series-steel-mod-0-8-pinion-gear-8mm-rex-bore-30-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1316/images/6489/2303-4008-0030-REV1-Ang1__83345__22761.1748029081.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Pinion Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2303 Series Steel, MOD 0.8 Pinion Gear (8mm REX® Bore, 36 Tooth)', '2303-4008-0036', 'This 36 Tooth, MOD 0.8 Steel Pinion Gear has an 8mm REX® bore for positive drive on goBILDA® signature 8mm REX® profile shafting. A MOD 0.8 gear with 84 teeth or 24 teeth is the perfect partner for this gear when you''re building on the goBILDA® pattern and want to create a 2.33:1 or 1.5:1 ratio. Of course, this gear can mesh with any MOD 0.8 gear to produce an underdrive or overdrive ratio—depending on if you''d like to increase the speed, or maximize torque—and it goes without saying that you…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2303-series-steel-mod-0-8-pinion-gear-8mm-rex-bore-36-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1369/images/14647/2303-4008-0036-Ang1__53680.1743169919.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Pinion Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2303 Series Steel, MOD 0.8 Pinion Gear (8mm REX® Bore, 40 Tooth)', '2303-4008-0040', 'This 40 Tooth, MOD 0.8 Steel Pinion Gear has an 8mm REX® bore for positive drive on goBILDA® signature 8mm REX® profile shafting. A MOD 0.8 gear with 80 teeth or 20 teeth is the perfect partner for this gear when you''re building on the goBILDA® pattern and want to create a 2:1 ratio (at either a distance of 48mm or 24mm, respectively). Of course, this gear can mesh with any MOD 0.8 gear to produce an underdrive or overdrive ratio—depending on if you''d like to increase the speed, or maximize…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2303-series-steel-mod-0-8-pinion-gear-8mm-rex-bore-40-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1371/images/14638/2303-4008-0040-Ang1__39310.1743169819.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Pinion Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2304 Series Brass, MOD 0.8 Pinion Gear (6mm Bore, 15 Tooth)', '2304-0006-0015', 'While this gear is compatible with any MOD 0.8 gear, it''s most common partner is a 105 tooth hub gear. The combo will create a 7:1 ratio, underdrive or overdrive depending on whether you''re set out to increase the speed or maximize torque.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2304-series-brass-mod-0-8-pinion-gear-6mm-bore-15-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/762/images/4371/2304-0006-0015__28513__72746.1701992175.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Pinion Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2304 Series Brass, MOD 0.8 Pinion Gear (6mm Bore, 20 Tooth)', '2304-0006-0020', 'This 20 tooth, MOD 0.8 gear will mate with any MOD 0.8 gear but when building on pattern; the most common partner for this gear is a 100 tooth hub gear. This combo will create a 5:1 ratio, underdrive or overdrive depending on whether you''re set out to increase the speed or maximize torque.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2304-series-brass-mod-0-8-pinion-gear-6mm-bore-20-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/764/images/4380/2304-0006-0020__97212__73562.1701992177.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Pinion Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2304 Series Brass, MOD 0.8 Pinion Gear (6mm Bore, 24 Tooth)', '2304-0006-0024', 'This 24 tooth, MOD 0.8 gear will mate with any MOD 0.8 gear. When building on pattern, the most common partner for this gear is a 96 tooth hub gear. This combo will create a 4:1 ratio, underdrive or overdrive depending on whether you''re set out to increase the speed or maximize torque.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2304-series-brass-mod-0-8-pinion-gear-6mm-bore-24-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/766/images/4390/2304-0006-0024__09661__49107.1701992180.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Pinion Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2304 Series Brass, MOD 0.8 Pinion Gear (6mm Bore, 30 Tooth)', '2304-0006-0030', 'This 30 tooth, MOD 0.8 gear will mate with any MOD 0.8 gear. When building on pattern, the most common partners for this gear are another 30 tooth gear, or a 90 tooth hub gear. Utilizing a second 30 tooth gear will create a compact 1:1 ratio on a 24mm center distance. A 1:1 ratio is useful when you have an assembly where you want two pieces to move at the same time, but in opposite directions. Mating with a 90 tooth hub gear will create a 3:1 ratio on 48mm centers and can be used as an…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2304-series-brass-mod-0-8-pinion-gear-6mm-bore-30-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/768/images/4400/2304-0006-0030__83785__39145.1701992183.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('2305 Series Brass, MOD 0.8, Servo Gear (24 Tooth Spline, 12 Tooth)', '2305-0024-0012', 'This 12 tooth servo gear is most commonly used to drive the 108 tooth hub gear, spaced 48mm away, in order to create a massive 9:1 ratio. For a more compact setup, it will also mate with a 48 tooth hub gear, spaced 24mm away to create a 4:1 ratio.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2305-series-brass-mod-0-8-servo-gear-24-tooth-spline-12-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/450/images/3130/2305-0024-0012__70892__38821.1701991795.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('2305 Series Brass, MOD 0.8, Servo Gear (24 Tooth Spline, 15 Tooth)', '2305-0024-0015', 'This 15 tooth servo gear is most commonly used to drive the 105 tooth hub gear, spaced 48mm away, in order to create a 7:1 ratio. This gear reduction will increase the torque at the hub gear to 7x what the servo produces. The sacrifice will be the reduction in range of motion and speed by the ratio.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2305-series-brass-mod-0-8-servo-gear-24-tooth-spline-15-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/452/images/3144/2305-0024-0015__52038__25004.1701991800.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('2305 Series Brass, MOD 0.8, Servo Gear (24 Tooth Spline, 20 Tooth)', '2305-0024-0020', 'This 20 tooth servo gear is most commonly used to drive the 100 tooth hub gear, spaced 48mm away, in order to create a 5:1 ratio. This gear reduction will increase the torque at the hub gear to 5x what the servo produces. The sacrifice will be the reduction in range of motion and speed by the ratio.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2305-series-brass-mod-0-8-servo-gear-24-tooth-spline-20-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/454/images/3158/2305-0024-0020__70118__42165.1701991805.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('2305 Series Brass, MOD 0.8, Servo Gear (24 Tooth Spline, 24 Tooth)', '2305-0024-0024', 'This 24 tooth servo gear is most commonly used to drive the 96 tooth hub gear, spaced 48mm away, in order to create a 4:1 ratio. This gear reduction will increase the torque at the hub gear to 4x what the servo produces. The sacrifice will be the reduction in range of motion and speed by the ratio.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2305-series-brass-mod-0-8-servo-gear-24-tooth-spline-24-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/456/images/3169/2305-0024-0024__27663__01451.1701991808.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('2305 Series Brass, MOD 0.8, Servo Gear (24 Tooth Spline, 30 Tooth)', '2305-0024-0030', 'This 30 tooth servo gear is most commonly used to drive the 90 tooth hub gear, spaced 48mm away, in order to create a 3:1 ratio. This gear reduction will increase the torque at the hub gear to 3x what the servo produces. This gear may also be used to drive a 30 tooth pinion gear spaced 24mm away for a 1:1 ratio.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2305-series-brass-mod-0-8-servo-gear-24-tooth-spline-30-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/458/images/3181/2305-0024-0030__59066__72715.1701991811.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('2305 Series Brass, MOD 0.8, Servo Gear (24 Tooth Spline, 40 Tooth)', '2305-0024-0040', 'This 40 tooth servo gear is most commonly used to drive the 80 tooth hub gear, spaced 48mm away, in order to create a 2:1 ratio. This gear may also be used to drive a 20 tooth pinion gear spaced 24mm away for a 2:1 overdrive if you''re set out to increase the rotation of the servo.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2305-series-brass-mod-0-8-servo-gear-24-tooth-spline-40-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/460/images/3192/2305-0024-0040__21961__81397.1701991814.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('2305 Series Brass, MOD 0.8, Servo Gear (25 Tooth Spline, 12 Tooth)', '2305-0025-0012', 'This 12 tooth servo gear is most commonly used to drive a 108 tooth hub-mount gear, spaced 48mm away, in order to create a massive 9:1 ratio. For a more compact setup, it can also mate with a 48 tooth hub gear spaced 24mm away to create a 4:1 ratio.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2305-series-brass-mod-0-8-servo-gear-25-tooth-spline-12-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/453/images/15113/2305-0025-0012-REV1__88995.1754663365.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Servo Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2305 Series Brass, MOD 0.8, Servo Gear (25 Tooth Spline, 15 Tooth)', '2305-0025-0015', 'This 15 tooth servo gear is most commonly used to drive the 105 tooth hub gear, spaced 48mm away, in order to create a 7:1 ratio. This gear reduction will increase the torque at the hub gear to 7x what the servo produces. The sacrifice will be the reduction in range of motion and speed by the ratio.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2305-series-brass-mod-0-8-servo-gear-25-tooth-spline-15-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/455/images/3164/2305-0025-0015__89902__46932.1701991807.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Servo Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2305 Series Brass, MOD 0.8, Servo Gear (25 Tooth Spline, 20 Tooth)', '2305-0025-0020', 'This 20 tooth servo gear is most commonly used to drive the 100 tooth hub gear, spaced 48mm away, in order to create a 5:1 ratio. This gear reduction will increase the torque at the hub gear to 5x what the servo produces. The sacrifice will be the reduction in range of motion and speed by the ratio.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2305-series-brass-mod-0-8-servo-gear-25-tooth-spline-20-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/457/images/3176/2305-0025-0020__68077__34191.1701991810.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Servo Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2305 Series Brass, MOD 0.8, Servo Gear (25 Tooth Spline, 24 Tooth)', '2305-0025-0024', 'This 24 tooth servo gear is most commonly used to drive the 96 tooth hub gear, spaced 48mm away, in order to create a 4:1 ratio. This gear reduction will increase the torque at the hub gear to 4x what the servo produces. The sacrifice will be the reduction in range of motion and speed by the ratio.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2305-series-brass-mod-0-8-servo-gear-25-tooth-spline-24-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/459/images/3187/2305-0025-0024__49118__80087.1701991813.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Servo Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2305 Series Brass, MOD 0.8, Servo Gear (25 Tooth Spline, 30 Tooth)', '2305-0025-0030', 'This 30 tooth servo gear is most commonly used to drive the 90 tooth hub gear, spaced 48mm away, in order to create a 3:1 ratio. This gear reduction will increase the torque at the hub gear to 3x what the servo produces. This gear may also be used to drive a 30 tooth pinion gear spaced 24mm away for a 1:1 ratio.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2305-series-brass-mod-0-8-servo-gear-25-tooth-spline-30-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/461/images/3197/2305-0025-0030__72472__27349.1701991816.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Servo Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2305 Series Brass, MOD 0.8, Servo Gear (25 Tooth Spline, 40 Tooth)', '2305-0025-0040', 'This 40 tooth servo gear is most commonly used to drive the 80 tooth hub gear, spaced 48mm away, in order to create a 2:1 ratio. This gear reduction will increase the torque at the hub gear to 2x what the servo produces. This gear may also be used to drive a 20 tooth pinion gear spaced 24mm away for a 2:1 overdrive if you''re set out to increase the rotation of the servo.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2305-series-brass-mod-0-8-servo-gear-25-tooth-spline-40-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/463/images/3207/2305-0025-0040__15285__53257.1701991820.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Servo Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2305 Series Brass, MOD 0.8, Servo Gear (25 Tooth Spline, 48 Tooth)', '2305-0025-0048', 'This 48 tooth servo gear is most commonly used to drive the 72 tooth hub gear, spaced 48mm away, in order to create a 1.5:1 ratio. This gear reduction will increase the torque at the hub gear to 1.5x what the servo produces.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2305-series-brass-mod-0-8-servo-gear-25-tooth-spline-48-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2477/images/16525/Ang2__45514.1776459111.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Servo Attachments', 'gobilda'),
  ('2306 Series Steel, MOD 1.5, Clamping Pinion Bevel Gear (6mm D-Bore, 14 Tooth)', '2306-1006-0014', 'This bevel pinion gear is intended to be used with the 28 Tooth Hub Mount Bevel Gear. The 2-piece clamping mechanism provides a gorilla-hold on a 6mm d-shaft for demanding applications.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2306-series-steel-mod-1-5-clamping-pinion-bevel-gear-6mm-d-bore-14-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/465/images/3221/2306-1006-0014_02__83042__29969.1701991825.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('2306 Series Steel, MOD 1.5, Clamping Pinion Bevel Gear (8mm REX® Bore, 14 Tooth)', '2306-4008-0014', 'This bevel pinion gear is intended to be used with the 28 Tooth Hub Mount Bevel Gear. The 2-piece clamping mechanism provides a robust hold on an 8mm REX® shaft for demanding applications.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2306-series-steel-mod-1-5-clamping-pinion-bevel-gear-8mm-rex-bore-14-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1363/images/6684/2306-4008-0014_03__53970__38209.1701992932.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('2307 Series Steel, MOD 1.5, Hub Mount Bevel Gear (14mm Bore, 28 Tooth)', '2307-0014-0028', 'The gear teeth of this hub mount bevel gear are cut specifically to mate with the 14 tooth Pinion Bevel Gear. The 14mm bore and standard 16mm hub pattern allows you to mount this to a hub with the bore of your choice. Sonic Hubs provide the most versatility as they can be mounted on the backside of the gear, but if you''re using 12mm REX shaft you''ll want to use a hyper hub on the front side of the gear.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2307-series-steel-mod-1-5-hub-mount-bevel-gear-14mm-bore-28-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/467/images/3232/2307-0014-0028__19826__00840.1701991828.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('2308 Series Stainless Steel, MOD 1.5, D-Bore Set Screw Worm (6mm Bore, 39mm Length)', '2308-0006-0039', 'This stainless worm is the mating gear to the 24 Tooth Brass Worm Gear. The two gears work together to create a 24:1 ratio gear reduction for low speed, high torque applications.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2308-series-stainless-steel-mod-1-5-d-bore-set-screw-worm-6mm-bore-39mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/469/images/3237/2308-0006-0039__21926__59208.1701991830.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('2309 Series Brass, MOD 1.5, Hub Mount Worm Gear (14mm Bore, 24 Tooth)', '2309-0014-0024', 'The 24 tooth brass worm gear is a mate to the stainless worm. The two gears work together to create a 24:1 gear reduction.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2309-series-brass-mod-1-5-hub-mount-worm-gear-14mm-bore-24-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/838/images/4627/2309-0014-0024__42309__55795.1701992251.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('Replacement Servo Gear Set (2000-2)', '2310-2000-0002', 'Whether you need to resuscitate a servo that has suffered damage to the internal gears, or you want the peace of mind provided by backup parts, having a replacement gear set on hand will help you keep your servo up-and-running! This Replacement Gear Set is for the Torque ratio of goBILDA® Servo. (The ratio is noted via either a Torque, Speed, or Super-Speed designation.) Please note that you cannot swap out a goBILDA® servo''s gears for any ratio that''s different than the ratio it came with, as…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/replacement-servo-gear-set-2000-2/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1277/images/12534/2310-2000-0002__72412.1719264017.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Servo Replacement Parts', 'gobilda'),
  ('Replacement Servo Gear Set (2000-3)', '2310-2000-0003', 'Whether you need to resuscitate a servo that has suffered damage to the internal gears, or you want the peace of mind provided by backup parts, having a replacement gear set on hand will help you keep your servo up-and-running! This Replacement Gear Set is for the Speed ratio of goBILDA® Servo. (The ratio is noted via either a Torque, Speed, or Super Speed designation.) Please note that you cannot swap out a goBILDA® servo''s gears for any ratio that''s different than the ratio it came with, as…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/replacement-servo-gear-set-2000-3/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1367/images/12535/2310-2000-0003__72706.1719264033.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Servo Replacement Parts', 'gobilda'),
  ('Servo Gear Set for 2000 Series ''Super Speed'' Servo', '2310-2000-0004', 'Whether you need to resuscitate a servo that has suffered damage to the internal gears, or you want the peace of mind provided by backup parts, having a replacement gear set on hand will help you keep your servo up-and-running! This Replacement Gear Set is for the Super Speed ratio of goBILDA® Servo. (The ratio is noted via either a Torque, Speed, or Super Speed designation.) Please note that you cannot swap out a goBILDA® servo''s gears for any ratio that''s different than the ratio it came…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servo-gear-set-for-2000-series-super-speed-servo/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1956/images/10565/2310-2000-0004__98652__53011.1701994149.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Servo Replacement Parts', 'gobilda'),
  ('Servo Gear Set for 2000 Series ''Torque'' Servo (V3.0)', '2310-2000-0302', 'Whether you need to resuscitate a servo that has suffered damage to the internal gears, or you want the peace of mind provided by backup parts, having a replacement gear set on hand will help you keep your servo up-and-running! This Replacement Gear Set is for the Torque ratio of goBILDA® Servo. (The ratio is noted via either a Torque, Speed, or Super-Speed designation.) Please note that you cannot swap out a goBILDA® servo''s gears for any ratio that''s different than the ratio it came with, as…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servo-gear-set-for-2000-series-torque-servo-v3-0/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2185/images/12524/2310-2000-0302-Servo-Gear-Set__86101__12994.1719245618.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Servo Replacement Parts', 'gobilda'),
  ('Servo Gear Set for 2000 Series ''Speed'' Servo (V3.0)', '2310-2000-0303', 'Whether you need to resuscitate a servo that has suffered damage to the internal gears, or you want the peace of mind provided by backup parts, having a replacement gear set on hand will help you keep your servo up-and-running! This Replacement Gear Set is for the Speed ratio of goBILDA® Servo. (The ratio is noted via either a Torque, Speed, or Super Speed designation.) Please note that you cannot swap out a goBILDA® servo''s gears for any ratio that''s different than the ratio it came with, as…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servo-gear-set-for-2000-series-speed-servo-v3-0/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2186/images/12525/2310-2000-0303-Servo-Gear-Set__96972__69014.1719245619.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Servo Replacement Parts', 'gobilda'),
  ('Servo Gear Set for 2000 Series ''Super Speed'' Servo (V3.0)', '2310-2000-0304', 'Whether you need to resuscitate a servo that has suffered damage to the internal gears, or you want the peace of mind provided by backup parts, having a replacement gear set on hand will help you keep your servo up-and-running! This Replacement Gear Set is for the Super Speed ratio of goBILDA® Servo. (The ratio is noted via either a Torque, Speed, or Super Speed designation.) Please note that you cannot swap out a goBILDA® servo''s gears for any ratio that''s different than the ratio it came…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/servo-gear-set-for-2000-series-super-speed-servo-v3-0/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2187/images/12526/2310-2000-0304__98094__19202.1719245621.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Servos / Servo Replacement Parts', 'gobilda'),
  ('Acetal MOD 0.8 Gear Rack (118 Tooth, 41 Hole)', '2311-0001-0118', 'This MOD 0.8 pitch, 118 tooth gear rack is the same one(4) used in the goBILDA® Servo-Driven Gear Rack Kits. The repeating 4mm holes make it easy to fasten to goBILDA® components to build a linear motion assembly. Because it is acetal, it is low-friction and has impressive wear characteristics.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/acetal-mod-0-8-gear-rack-118-tooth-41-hole/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1966/images/10633/2311-0001-0118__11879__91017.1701994168.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('Acetal MOD 0.8 Gear Rack (131 Tooth, 41 Hole)', '2311-0001-0131', 'This MOD 0.8 pitch, 131 tooth gear rack is the same one(5) used in the goBILDA® Servo-Driven Gear Rack Kits. The repeating 4mm holes make it easy to fasten to goBILDA® components to build a linear motion assembly. Because it is acetal, it is low-friction and has impressive wear characteristics. For longer assemblies, multiple gear-racks can be lined up end-to end--rest assured that the teeth will align for a nearly seamless transition between racks, and the mounting holes will remain on-grid for…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/acetal-mod-0-8-gear-rack-131-tooth-41-hole/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2474/images/15773/2311-0001-0131-REV0__72660.1768598787.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Gear Racks', 'gobilda'),
