  ('66 Tooth Hub-Mount Gear (MOD 0.8, 4mm Thick Acetal)', '2312-0414-0066', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/66-tooth-hub-mount-gear-mod-0-8-4mm-thick-acetal/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1565/images/8196/2312-0014-0066__51197__57564.1701993388.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Hub Mount Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('68 Tooth Hub-Mount Gear (MOD 0.8, 4mm Thick Acetal)', '2312-0414-0068', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/68-tooth-hub-mount-gear-mod-0-8-4mm-thick-acetal/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1567/images/8210/2312-0014-0068__43799__16778.1701993391.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Hub Mount Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('70 Tooth Hub-Mount Gear (MOD 0.8, 4mm Thick Acetal)', '2312-0414-0070', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/70-tooth-hub-mount-gear-mod-0-8-4mm-thick-acetal/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1569/images/8224/2312-0014-0070__56446__67268.1701993395.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Hub Mount Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('72 Tooth Hub-Mount Gear (MOD 0.8, 4mm Thick Acetal)', '2312-0414-0072', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/72-tooth-hub-mount-gear-mod-0-8-4mm-thick-acetal/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1571/images/8238/2312-0014-0072__28553__35973.1701993399.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Hub Mount Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('74 Tooth Hub-Mount Gear (MOD 0.8, 4mm Thick Acetal)', '2312-0414-0074', null, 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/74-tooth-hub-mount-gear-mod-0-8-4mm-thick-acetal/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1572/images/8246/2312-0014-0074__53553__12952.1701993403.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Hub Mount Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('80 Tooth Hub-Mount Gear (MOD 0.8, 4mm Thick Acetal)', '2312-0414-0080', 'This 80 tooth, MOD 0.8 gear can mate with any MOD 0.8 gear. However, when building on pattern, the most common partner for this gear is a 40 tooth servo gear. This combo creates a 2:1 underdrive, slowing the final speed while doubling the torque.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/80-tooth-hub-mount-gear-mod-0-8-4mm-thick-acetal/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1969/images/10650/2312-0414-0080__89494__57627.1701994174.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Hub Mount Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('90 Tooth Hub-Mount Gear (MOD 0.8, 4mm Thick Acetal)', '2312-0414-0090', 'The 90 tooth, MOD 0.8 gear can mate with any MOD 0.8 gear, but when building on pattern, the most common partner for this gear is a 30 tooth pinion gear or servo gear. Using the pinion gear, you can create a 3:1 underdrive or overdrive setup (depending on your application). When used with the 30 tooth servo gear, this combo creates a 3:1 underdrive that facilitates slower speed and three times the torque.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/90-tooth-hub-mount-gear-mod-0-8-4mm-thick-acetal/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1971/images/10666/2312-0414-0090__38233__69304.1701994179.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Hub Mount Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('96 Tooth Hub-Mount Gear (MOD 0.8, 4mm Thick Acetal)', '2312-0414-0096', 'The 96 tooth, MOD 0.8 gear can mate with any MOD 0.8 gear, but when building on pattern, the most common partner for this gear is a 24 tooth pinion gear or servo gear. Using the pinion gear, you can create a 4:1 underdrive or overdrive setup (depending on your application). When used with the 24 tooth servo gear, this combo creates a 4:1 underdrive that facilitates slower speed and four times the torque.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/96-tooth-hub-mount-gear-mod-0-8-4mm-thick-acetal/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1972/images/10676/2312-0414-0096__34444__39168.1701994183.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Hub Mount Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('100 Tooth Hub-Mount Gear (MOD 0.8, 4mm Thick Acetal)', '2312-0414-0100', 'The 100 tooth, MOD 0.8 gear will mate with any MOD 0.8 gear, but when building on pattern, the most common partner for this gear is a 20 tooth pinion gear or servo gear. Using the pinion gear, you can create a 5:1 underdrive or overdrive setup (depending on your application). When used with the 20 tooth servo gear, this combo creates a 5:1 underdrive that facilitates slower speed and five times the torque.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/100-tooth-hub-mount-gear-mod-0-8-4mm-thick-acetal/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1974/images/10694/2312-0414-0100__99199__36836.1701994187.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Hub Mount Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2313 Series Stainless Steel, MOD 1.25 Worm (6mm D-Bore, 34mm Length)', '2313-1006-0034', 'This 6mm D-Bore Worm is cut specifically to mate with our MOD 1.25, 28 tooth hub mount worm gear to create a massive 28:1 gear reduction. M5 set-screws limit the worm from moving axially in builds that do not already capture the worm from moving up and down a shaft. This worm gear''s 34mm length allows it to fit inside 1120 Series U-Channel while providing the necessary space to run 6mm ID ball bearings and 6mm ID thrust bearings on each side. Radial bearings allow the D-shaft driving the…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2313-series-stainless-steel-mod-1-25-worm-6mm-d-bore-34mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1823/images/9814/2313-1006-0034__90573__96549.1701993911.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('2313 Series Stainless Steel, MOD 1.25 Worm (8mm REX® Bore, 33mm Length)', '2313-4008-0033', 'This 8mm REX® Bore Worm is cut specifically to mate with our MOD 1.25, 28 tooth hub mount worm gear to create a massive 28:1 gear reduction. The 8mm REX™ bore matches perfectly with our 8mm REX® shafting in order to create a positive drive. The four M5 set-screws limit the worm from moving axially in builds that do not already capture the worm from moving up and down the shaft. The 33mm length allows this worm to slide down inside channel while providing the necessary space to run 8mm ball…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2313-series-stainless-steel-mod-1-25-worm-8mm-rex-bore-33mm-length/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1506/images/7697/2313-4008-0033__79294__75154.1701993239.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('2314 Series Brass, MOD 1.25, Hub Mount Worm Gear (14mm Bore, 28 Tooth)', '2314-0014-0028', 'This Hub Mount Worm Gear is intended to mate with our MOD 1.25 Worm to create a massive 28:1 gear reduction. This worm gear is machined from H59 hardened brass in order to create a low coefficient of friction against the stainless steel worm, while handling the massive torque this 28:1 setup can generate. The counterbored thru-holes allow M4 socket head screws to nest down into the gear to maximize clearance, or you can fasten a thru-hole part to the threaded holes.', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2314-series-brass-mod-1-25-hub-mount-worm-gear-14mm-bore-28-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1508/images/7710/Ang1__40171__55419.1701993243.386.513.jpg?c=1', null, 'gobilda'),
  ('2315 Series, Steel Miter Gear (MOD 1.25, Set-Screw, 6mm D-Bore, 30 Tooth)', '2315-1006-0030', 'This 6mm D-Bore Miter Gear is able to mate with any other 2315 Series Miter Gear. A miter gear is a specific type of bevel gear. Two mating miter gears create a 1:1 ratio, and transmit power at a 90 degree angle due to the 45 degree pitch cone angle. The underneath side of this gear has been dished out to allow a thrust bearing to set the location of the gear (relative to the inside wall of an 1120 Series U-Channel) and counteract the potential spreading forces in the most extreme…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2315-series-steel-miter-gear-mod-1-25-set-screw-6mm-d-bore-30-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1362/images/6670/2315-1006-0030_Ang2__06625__26471.1701992927.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Bevel Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2315 Series, Steel Miter Gear (MOD 1.25, Set-Screw, 8mm REX® Bore, 30 Tooth)', '2315-4008-0030', 'This 8mm REX® Bore Miter Gear is able to mate with any other 2315 Series Miter Gear. A miter gear is a specific type of bevel gear. Two mating miter gears create a 1:1 ratio, and transmit power at a 90 degree angle due to the 45 degree pitch cone angle. The underneath side of this gear has been dished out to allow a thrust bearing to set the location of the gear (relative to the inside wall of an 1120 Series U-Channel) and counteract the potential spreading forces in the most extreme…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2315-series-steel-miter-gear-mod-1-25-set-screw-8mm-rex-bore-30-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1364/images/6701/2315-4008-0030_Ang2__44424__18081.1701992937.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Bevel Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2317 Series MOD 0.8 Steel Miter Gear (Set-Screw, 6mm Round Bore, 24 Tooth)', '2317-0006-0024', 'Miter gears are a specific type of a bevel gear that create a 1:1 ratio at 90° due to their 45° pitch cone angle. Though we also offer the larger 2315 Series Miter Gears, 2317 Series Miter Gears are sized for more intricate applications that benefit from compactness and lesser rotating mass! This 6mm Round Bore Miter Gear is compatible with 6mm round and 6mm D-shaft alike. It''s able to mesh with any other 2317 Series Miter Gear, regardless of the mating gear''s bore size. Simply space the back…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2317-series-mod-0-8-steel-miter-gear-set-screw-6mm-round-bore-24-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1828/images/9855/2317-0006-0024_Ang2__44067__54819.1701993921.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Bevel Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2317 Series MOD 0.8 Steel Miter Gear (Set-Screw, 8mm REX® Bore, 24 Tooth)', '2317-4008-0024', 'Miter gears are a specific type of a bevel gear that create a 1:1 ratio at 90° due to their 45° pitch cone angle. Though we also offer the larger 2315 Series Miter Gears, 2317 Series Miter Gears are sized for more intricate applications that benefit from compactness and lesser rotating mass! This 8mm REX® Bore Miter Gear is able to mesh with any other 2317 Series Miter Gear, regardless of bore size. Simply space the back of each miter gear 20mm from the center of the shaft driving the other…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2317-series-mod-0-8-steel-miter-gear-set-screw-8mm-rex-bore-24-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/1825/images/9845/2317-4008-0024_Ang2__83093__09431.1701993918.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Bevel Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('2319 Series MOD 1.25 Steel Miter Gear (8mm REX® Bore, 30 Tooth)', '2319-4008-0030', 'This 8mm REX® bore 2319 Series Miter Gear is designed to mesh with another 2319 Series Miter Gear while achieving positive drive on 8mm REX® shafting. A miter gear is a specific type of bevel gear. When meshed together, a pair of miter gears creates a 1:1 ratio and transmits power at a 90 degree angle due to the 45 degree pitch cone angle. Engineered for High-Torque Applications The 2319 Series Miter Gears are specially designed to maximize performance in high-torque applications. The large…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/2319-series-mod-1-25-steel-miter-gear-8mm-rex-bore-30-tooth/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2027/images/11107/Ang1__50693__22514.1701994318.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Bevel Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('Clamping Steel Miter Gear (6mm D-Bore, 24 Tooth, MOD 1)', '2320-1006-0024', 'This 6mm D-bore 2320 Series Miter Gear is designed to mesh with another 2320 Series Miter Gear while achieving positive drive on 6mm D-profile shafting. While all bevel gears transmit power at special angles, bevel gears that are designed to create a 1:1 ratio and transmit power at a 90 degree angle due to the 45 degree pitch cone angle are ordained as "miter gears." Designed for Heavy Duty 2320 Series Miter Gears are specially designed to maximize performance in high-torque applications. The…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/clamping-steel-miter-gear-6mm-d-bore-24-tooth-mod-1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2363/images/16454/2320-1006-0024-Ang2__38213.1774965023.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Bevel Gears', 'gobilda'),
  ('Clamping Steel Miter Gear (8mm REX® Bore, 24 Tooth, MOD 1)', '2320-4008-0024', 'This 8mm REX® bore 2320 Series Miter Gear is designed to mesh with another 2320 Series Miter Gear while achieving positive drive on 8mm REX® shafting. While all bevel gears transmit power at special angles, bevel gears that are designed to create a 1:1 ratio and transmit power at a 90 degree angle due to the 45 degree pitch cone angle are ordained as "miter gears." Designed for Heavy Duty 2320 Series Miter Gears are specially designed to maximize performance in high-torque applications. The…', 'goBILDA', null, true, 'https://www.gobilda.com/clamping-steel-miter-gear-8mm-rex-bore-24-tooth-mod-1/', 'https://cdn11.bigcommerce.com/s-x56mtydx1w/products/2182/images/16457/2320-4008-0024-Ang2__52533.1774965383.386.513.jpg?c=1', 'MOTION / Gears / Bevel Gears', 'gobilda')
